# Probe captures: 2.8 GB of generated evidence (PNG screenshots, log JSON,
# CSV result tables) regenerated by the `report-*.ts` scripts in this package.
#
# They are consumed only from INSIDE this package, and the monorepo's workspaces
# symlink rather than copy, so nothing here loses access to them. What does copy
# is a `file:` dependent — `v2/frontend` depends on
# `file:../../packages/tealscript`, so every `yarn install` there duplicated the
# whole capture tree into its `node_modules`. That is what filled a self-hosted
# runner's disk and failed `v2 Frontend Master (SG)` with
# `ENOSPC: no space left on device` while copying a probe screenshot.
oracle-probes/
